# Review rubric for the UI design of a spec (ui-design/: screens.md, screens/*.svg, tokens.json; read by sdkit review plan design). Copy to <project-dir>/review.d/design.env to change it.
# Names are EGM shortnames: reviewer = agents/<name>.md, standard = resources/document_standards/<name>.md of the egm plugin.
# Reviewed by fresh reviewers, never by the designer. Looks at: every pre-spec behaviour has a screen, every screen has its states, flows reach no dead end, screen ids are stable, tokens are consistent, accessibility basics are stated.
REVIEWERS="design_critic structural comprehension"
STANDARDS="design_critic=feature-spec-standard structural=feature-spec-standard"
CONTEXT=".sdkit/project.md"
# REVIEWERS_R1="structural"
# TIER_R1=light
